    <h2>3.4 Break-Even Point (BEP) Analysis</h2>
    <p>Financial viability for the international gateway was calculated using unit economics[cite: 1]:</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Fixed Gateway Cost (F):</strong> $50,000[cite: 1]</li>
      <li><strong>Variable Cost per Transaction (V):</strong> $3[cite: 1]</li>
      <li><strong>Service Fee Revenue per Transaction (P):</strong> $5[cite: 1]</li>
      <li><strong>Formula:</strong> $BEPu = \frac{F}{P - V} = \frac{50,000}{5 - 3} = \mathbf{25,000\text{ transactions}}$[cite: 1]</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem;">Processing only 25,000 transactions recoups initial integration investments[cite: 1]. Across bKash's multi-million active user base, this volume is readily achievable[cite: 1].</p>

